- All 35 correct areas in the Hub with the right names and codes.

- Five report types rendering correctly from live data.

- Hub Lite loading on mobile, capturing notes and meeting shells to Supabase.

- Supabase sync working — pending captures visible in Hub, committable to OneDrive.

